WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.491 --> 00:00:02.240
(dramatic music)
(squeak)

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.073
- Zim!

00:00:03.073 --> 00:00:03.970
(thunder crashing)

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.180
- Yes, it is I!

00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:07.610
Oh, wait, sorry.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.420
You'll have to move along hideous goblin,

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:12.400
I'm posing dramatically
for when the Dib shows up.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.233
- I am Dib.

00:00:13.233 --> 00:00:14.237
- What?

00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:15.822
Oh, ah, uh.

00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:18.239
I've been expecting you, Dib.

00:00:19.344 --> 00:00:21.763
(evil laughing)

00:00:21.763 --> 00:00:25.620
- [Dib] Invader Zim, evil alien soldier,

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.530
disguised as one of us,

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:31.547
sent to infiltrate Earth
with his mechanical servants.

00:00:31.547 --> 00:00:32.980
(alien yelling)

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.333
My name is Dib Membrane,

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:37.460
and I'm all that stands

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:42.022
between Zim and the
annihilation of our world.

00:00:42.022 --> 00:00:45.502
(dramatic orchestra music)

00:00:45.502 --> 00:00:46.335
(cat screeching)

00:00:46.335 --> 00:00:48.610
- Oh man, Dib, not the coat.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.340
- It makes me look mysterious.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.567
Step aside, I've got a Zim to stop!

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:57.150
(dramatic orchestra music)

00:00:59.679 --> 00:01:04.679
(gun firing)
(electrical zapping)

00:01:07.981 --> 00:01:10.378
- You gotta order a million pizzas,

00:01:10.378 --> 00:01:13.093
and then I gotta roll
around in them pizzas,

00:01:13.093 --> 00:01:17.083
and that's the story about
how I turn into a giant pizza.

00:01:18.228 --> 00:01:20.645
(squeaking)

